    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20494" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βουβών</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῶνος</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>groin</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				4.492
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοινὸν μέρος . . μηροῦ καὶ ἤτρου β.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>HA</u>
					493b9
				</span></i>
			: in pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέχρι βουβώνων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pherecr.
					23
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				56
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> in pl.,
				<i>glands</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Epid.</u>
				2.2.24
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>swollen gland</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Aph.</u>
				4.55
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				883b21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Georg.</u>
				51
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				J.
				<u>Ap.</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			= Lat. <i>bubo, owl</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>AJ</u>
				18.6.7
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				19.8.2
			</span></i>.</div>
